            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468414+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "The strong winds blew snow into the snowdrifts.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468414+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-10664",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-10664",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-10664",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:d86917c95a466349d80917edf8b17846058bd185643e47ef7051474c750942f3",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468420+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "With Gary Versace on piano, Gary Hobbs on drums, and Chuck Bergeron on bass, the trio performs with a wide range of artists and ensembles.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468420+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8013",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8013",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8013",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:4ccbad15734fc71ea323fd68ef2095efe801583f195f195978534983f1f423e2",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468421+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "NASA Kepler mission sends names into space.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468421+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8108",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8108",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8108",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:678416451fe0fc4bae5138dd9bff696f3800262568d4776175d5a76dc0a51eb1",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468429+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "The pretexts offered were laughable, and the response caused scarcely a ripple on the flood of commentary on Washington's noble \"efforts to spread democracy\".",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468429+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8675",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8675",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8675",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:538b2be456e69b79ae246a5f77c704750b7500d4e581f89ab3a5d1ee3f8c6d55",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468434+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "The order, issued Nov. 16 by Eric Landoll, the city's code administrator, states that the roof of the building is allowing rain to fall into the interior of the building and because of this the interior floors are structurally unsound and there is mold and mildew throughout the building causing health concerns for anyone entering the building.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468434+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8837",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-8837",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-8837",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:106a2243f80b33e54ed3c76657d9b70cc756a1dbb9ffbac33120da73400d6f2c",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468440+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "They (the aquarium) were brushing the shark's teeth.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468440+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b44-semeval-9805",
