            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468445+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b44",
            "text": "A stone was put inside a freshly made pot, then it was pressed against the metal.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:42:16.468445+00:00"
          },
          {
